# The phases of K1 a player can load straight into: each line a checkpoint
# the chain keeps and its save's title, in story order. `kjk chain k1`
# writes them as saves k1-01, k1-02, ... (the main checkout always, a
# worktree with --saves), loaded from the Load screen or `kjk --load k1-05`.
# A new game is the Endar Spire. Method: docs/PLAYTESTS.md.
taris_start     Taris: the Upper City
lower_city      Taris: the Lower City
undercity       Taris: the Undercity
lower_sewers    Taris: the sewers
vulkar_base     Taris: the Black Vulkar base
vulkar_out      Taris: the swoop race
bastila         Taris: Bastila freed
sith_base       Taris: the Sith base
sith_base_out   Taris: the escape
dantooine       Dantooine
tatooine        Tatooine
kashyyyk        Kashyyyk
manaan          Manaan
leviathan       The Leviathan
korriban        Korriban
unknown_world   The Unknown World
uw_temple       The Unknown World: the temple
star_forge      The Star Forge
dk_star_forge   The Star Forge, the dark side's way
